cd/data/MSC/*.PCM
# The room-background archives. The originals are the Zork I (Japan) disc's
# assets, staged by tools/assets/bg.bat and injected post-build, so they are
# never committed and never enter the base ISO. GEN*.CGL are the opposite on
# every count: they are our own generated pictures, they cannot be rebuilt
# without both Pillow and the staged originals to grade against, and taking
# ~25 minutes on four workers is not something a release build should spend --
# so they are committed and the ordinary build bakes them into the ISO. The
# record they are checked against is tools/assets/art/frames.json, which carries
# a size and SHA-256 per archive; saturn/tests/test_art_archives.py holds them
# to it, and both workflows check the built disc itself.
cd/data/BG/*.CGL
!cd/data/BG/GEN*.CGL
cd/data/BG/OITEM.CZ
build.log

